<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Stella - (built 1983) 64,780 dwt sold to Indonesian buyers for $9.5 million including two years timecharter back.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Tonbridge - (built 1977) 267,911 dwt sold to Singapore buyers for $7.25 million.</p>
<p>Entalina - (built 1978) 31,486 dwt sold to UK based buyers for $7 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
